ng Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">May 21, 2026</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <section class=\"new-products\" id=\"new\">\n                <h2>New Products</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://emdash.sh\" target=\"_blank\">Emdash</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Open-source desktop app for running multiple coding agents in parallel with isolated worktrees. Provider-agnostic platform supporting 28+ coding agent providers with SSH support for remote machines, diff review, and PR shipping.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Product Hunt | 2026-05-21</div>\n                    <span class=\"category\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"One app, every coding agent\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/runtime-sandboxed-coding-agents\" target=\"_blank\">Runtime</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Sandboxed coding agents platform for teams. Provides isolated environments for running AI coding agents with team collaboration features via Slack integration.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Product Hunt | 2026-05-21</div>\n                    <span class=\"category\">code agent</span>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Sandboxed coding agents for everyone on your team\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/re_gent\" target=\"_blank\">Re_gent</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Version control system for AI agent activity. Shows what coding agents changed, which prompts caused changes, and enables rollback across files and sessions. Git for AI agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Product Hunt | 2026-05-21</div>\n                    <span class=\"category\">workflow agent</span>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Shows what your agent did and which prompt wrote each line of code\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/glia-2\" target=\"_blank\">Glia</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Local-first AI memory bridge between browser chats and IDEs. Chrome extension that auto-saves web-based Claude/ChatGPT conversations and serves them via MCP to IDEs for persistent context.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Product Hunt | 2026-05-21</div>\n                    <span class=\"category\">workflow agent</span>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"100% offline and open-source memory bridge\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://contextberg.com\" target=\"_blank\">Contextberg</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Local memory app for AI agents that watches screens, browser history, and agent conversations in the background, serving context to coding agents via MCP protocol.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">Product Hunt | 2026-05-21</div>\n                    <span class=\"category\">workflow agent</span>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Turn your work into AI agent memory, served over MCP\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"updates\">\n                <h2>Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"update-badge\">RELEASE</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Aider v0.56.0</div>\n                    <di